### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### 🎬 CONTENT — TRENDING
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Get all trending content
GET {{baseUrl}}/content/trending

### Get trending movies only
GET {{baseUrl}}/content/trending?type=movie&limit=5

### Get trending games only
GET {{baseUrl}}/content/trending?type=game&limit=5


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### 🎬 CONTENT — SEARCH
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Search content by title keyword (e.g. matrix)
GET {{baseUrl}}/content/search?query=matrix

### Search and filter by type (movies only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/content/search?query=matrix&type=game

### Search and filter by genre (e.g. Action)
GET {{baseUrl}}/content/search?genre=Action

### get content details by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/content/6a0d6ddf27306f6785eba5df


### Add content to user history
POST {{baseUrl}}/content/history
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId":"6a0c33cd192aac16eddde473",
    "contentId":"6a0d6ddf27306f6785eba5df"
}


### add content to user's wishlist
POST {{baseUrl}}/content/wishlist
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId":"6a0c33cd192aac16eddde473",
    "contentId":"6a0d6ddf27306f6785eba5df"
}


### remove content from user's wishlist
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/content/wishlist/remove
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId":"6a0c33cd192aac16eddde473",
    "contentId":"6a0d6ddf27306f6785eba5df"
}